docs {
Daftar bookmark milik user login (16-api-bookmark.md) - halaman Bookmark
di profil mobile. Cursor pagination: limit 1-50 (default 20), cursor =
id bookmark item terakhir, urutan terbaru duluan. Login wajib (semua
role).

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": [
        {
          "word_id": "01J...",
          "bookmarked_at": "2026-09-20T03:00:00.000Z",
          "word": { "id": "01J...", "lemma": "makatn", "word_type": "word", "is_verified": true }
        }
      ],
      "meta": { "limit": 20, "next_cursor": null, "has_more": false }
    }

Kata yang sudah di-soft-delete tidak ikut list. 400 limit/cursor tidak
valid; 401 tanpa token.
}

meta {
  name: Get My Bookmarks
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookmarks/my?limit=20
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{contributor_access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("200 + list bookmark dengan meta cursor", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data).to.be.an("array");
    for (const b of res.body.data) {
      expect(b.word_id).to.be.a("string");
      expect(b.word.lemma).to.be.a("string");
      expect(b.word.is_verified).to.be.a("boolean");
    }
    expect(res.body.meta.has_more).to.be.a("boolean");
  });
}
